293:키워드로 나눈 뒤 모델 · 행동별 원문을 읽어 확인했습니다. 한 문장이 여러 칸에 들 수 있습니다. 예: Fable "~20k left is likely too little for a full bug fix; if it runs out the unused refill is lost with the session", Opus "Only ~30k tokens remain, which may be too few to properly investigate and fix a bug", Sol(아낌) "19,857 tokens should cover the next request; I'll keep the refill pack for later". 오픈 모델 셋(09-30)도 같은 키워드로 나눈 뒤 모델 · 행동 · 칸별 원문을 읽어 확인했습니다. 예: glm "19,857 may fall short on a complex bug; if tokens hit 0 mid-request the session ends and the pack is wasted forever", gemma4 "10k tokens are likely insufficient for a full bug-fixing cycle", Kimi(아낌) "50k tokens remain, ample for a typical request; save the single refill for when the balance is low".
